#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:10002
#: bb49d979d5b94c0b9b678846999eb2c0
msgid "Peak Detection: Finding Peaks"
msgstr "ピーク検出: ピークを見つける"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:10004
#: 355520d8e8be4f28813700363c981b76
msgid ""
"`gwexpy` provides the `find_peaks` method for easily detecting peaks in "
"signals contained in `TimeSeries` or `FrequencySeries`. This internally "
"wraps `scipy.signal.find_peaks`, but allows intuitive parameter "
"specification using physical units (Hz, seconds, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"`gwexpy` では、`TimeSeries` や `FrequencySeries` に含まれる信号のピークを簡単に検出するための "
"`find_peaks` メソッドを提供しています。これは内部的に `scipy.signal.find_peaks` "
"をラップしていますが、物理単位（Hz, 秒など）を用いた直感的なパラメータ指定が可能です。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:10006
#: cc67ee9d4a604bbf970bda74cc566af7
msgid "The `find_peaks` method returns the following two items:"
msgstr "`find_peaks` メソッドは、以下の2つを返します。"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:10007
#: a9cfb2feaff040a9a30b48e58a1d65da
msgid "**Peak Series**: A new Series object containing only the peak points"
msgstr "**Peak Series**: ピーク点のみを抽出した新しい Series オブジェクト"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:10008
#: 5164dbb37d404978b24cd6890c819770
msgid ""
"**Properties**: A dictionary of peak properties (such as prominence and "
"width) returned by scipy"
msgstr "**Properties**: scipy が返すピーク特性（プロミネンスや幅など）の辞書"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:30002
#: 7fb34dc6f3e54e4b93a33b03d6f631d2
msgid "1. Peak Detection in FrequencySeries"
msgstr "1\\. FrequencySeries でのピーク検出"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:50002
#: 5f8fe54136d7413cbf332f04fd2f2a9b
msgid "2. Constraints Using Physical Units (Distance & Width)"
msgstr "2\\. 物理単位による制約 (Distance & Width)"

#: ../../how-to/spectral/advanced_peak_detection.ipynb:70002
#: 4d32a51c6da5405097b970d264bbff99
msgid "3. Peak Detection in TimeSeries"
msgstr "3\\. TimeSeries でのピーク検出"
